From 38865f2b4aa2d20d327edea7428c9c7bbacef215 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 16:10:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 08120/11362] [outer-loop] Win-transition exposure: available
 at 30/128 live induce calls, delivered at 0

EXPOSURE BEFORE EFFECT, on the 2026-08-01 win-transition change
(arc_competition_agent.py:4710/:4946/:6429-6433 + the win_transition kwarg
through arc_executable_world_model). Measured on the LIVE path -- E3AgentPolicy
built with the exact SUBMITTED_AGENT_CONFIG kwargs make_carnot_agent uses,
driven by the shipped arc_leaderboard_eval.run_game against the offline arcade.
CPU only: no GGUF, no llama-server, no CUDA, no scored game, nothing submitted.
103 cells = 25 public games x {400, 2000} actions x 3 frontier_discipline_seeds,
zero coverage gaps.

AVAILABILITY. self._win_transition was non-None at 30 of 128 induce calls
(23.4% pooled). Reported with the roster spread, not instead of it: the
game-clustered mean is 15.7%, the roster MEDIAN is 0.0, vc33 is the MAXIMUM at
1.0, and 14 of 25 games are at exactly zero (20 of 25 at the shipped 400-action
cap, where the pooled rate is 17.8%).

DELIVERY IS ZERO, AND THAT IS THE RESULT. The changed call site received a win
transition at 0 of 128 calls, at both budgets. _induce_and_plan routes into
execute_bounded_llm_reinduction whenever the reason is level_up_reinduction OR
next_level_episode (:6138) and RETURNS at :6245; that module's _call_induce
(arc_llm_reinduction.py:203-220) has no win_transition parameter at all.
next_level_episode is set by _begin_level_goal_episode -- the same function, at
the same instant, that sets _win_transition -- so the routing predicate and the
availability predicate are the same predicate in practice.

VERIFIED TWICE, because the first pass was an inference off a skip string.
(1) The skip-string partition is exact: 98/98 no-win calls reached the changed
site, 30/30 win-available calls did not, zero off-diagonal across 128 calls.
(2) verify_kwarg.py instruments the RECEIVING end -- the proposer's own induce,
with the caller read off the stack -- across all five level-banking games: the
keyword was absent on all 12 reinduction-path calls and None on all 4 that
carried it.

CONSEQUENCE. A live effect A/B has 0 discordant pairs available, so its
smallest reachable two-sided p is 1.0 -- unfalsifiable, not underpowered.
Stated before any effect number exists, not after. Two further gates are
recorded: 0 of 240 live induce attempts on the real-generator corpus installed
a plan at all, and _goal_only_prompt (the focused win-condition prompt) never
receives the argument either.

SEED AXIS. Replicates vary frontier_discipline_seed, the seed the agent
actually consumes; 2 of 25 game-budget cells flip their level count on it. The
argv-seed A/A is identically zero on 3/3 probes -- recorded as proof that a
global random.seed cannot reach random.Random(constructor default), i.e. that
the axis was not exercised, NOT as a noise floor.

The change ships with no default-OFF env flag; the gate is owed regardless of
what is decided about the routing.

